    "idea": "Nested Rings Conjunction (NEW): clear the patrolling Satellite Eye, rotate the nested Orrery Rings to 90 degrees to open the North bridge to the Astronomer's Study, then pin the alignment latch unlocking both the North Study door and East Key-3 vault bridge!",
